html
  body
    h1 Reset your Alarm calendar password

    p Hello #{person.name.length > 0 ? person.name : person.email}!
    p A password reset was requested for your 4H Alarm Calendar account. If you did not request this, you can safely ignore this email and your password will remain unchanged.
    p This link will expire 20 minutes after this email was sent.

    p
      a(href="#{hostname}/forgotpassword?id=#{person.reset_password_id}") Reset your password

    p #{emailDisclaimer}
